<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - LifeCell started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - LifeCell started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of LifeCell Corp as outperform.</p>
<p>-- Set a two-year price target of $12-$16 a share.</p>
<p>-- Believes LifeCell is poised for rapid growth.</p>
<p>-- Set 1997 earnings estimate of a loss of $1.10 a share and a 1998 estimate of a profit of $0.25 a share.</p>
<p>- Said LifeCell has an &quot;unduly low&quot; valuation.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 9/16 to 4-5/8 in morning trade.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
